sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Team Member
    participant Client as AI Tool<br/>(Claude / ChatGPT)
    participant MCP as Coconut MCP
    participant CTX as Context Layer
    participant Agent as Space Agent

    User->>Client: "Draft Q3 board deck"
    Client->>MCP: Request context
    MCP->>CTX: Fetch relevant pages
    CTX-->>MCP: Sourced, current context
    MCP-->>Client: Inject into prompt
    Client-->>User: Draft with sourced figures

    User->>Client: Propose a change
    Client->>CTX: Open Task
    CTX->>CTX: Owner reviews + approves

    Note over Agent,CTX: Background (scheduled)
    Agent->>CTX: Fold new transcripts
    Agent->>CTX: Flag stale content
    Agent->>CTX: Refresh research
